<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>For My Bujji Only</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: pink;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #fff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .heart {
            font-size: 100px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .heart:hover {
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }
        .message {
            display: none;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #fff;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>For My Bujji Only</h1>
    <div id="heart" class="heart">❤️</div>
    <div id="message" class="message">
        Oyee Bujji 😘 Kese ho? <br>
        Thume thank you bol naa tha ☺️ <br>
        Joo tum mere itna khayal jo rakh ti hoo ☺️😘 <br>
        Thank you sooo much ree Bujji ☺️ <br>
        Sach kahu too thumare bina kuch bhi aacha nahi lag taa 🥺 <br>
        Kabhi galti ho jai to thumare pura haak hee tum maro yaa dato, per chood kee kabhi chale maat jana bina bataye 🥺 <br>
        Bass itna hii ☺️ <br>
        Aapna khayal rakh naa 😘🥰
    </div>

    <script>
        document.getElementById('heart').onclick = function() {
            document.getElementById('message').style.display = 'block';
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
